// The syscall surface (docs/01-kernel-ipc.md §3), one line per call.
// The order gives the syscall number. A new line needs an ADR that says what it
// replaces or why nothing can. `./build loc` counts the lines.
// Draft until ADR-0004 freezes vx-abi v0.

